Z||000000||Dan||09-09-1999||11:06 AM|||| Can't decide what to do with 'em.It isn't a <BR>infatuation thing,I just can't pass a good deal.My first one I paid $300 for but it needed a lot of work.I took my iron duke out of my Ciera and pulled the engine from the Fiero from the top. Tires, brakes,suspension,<BR>alternator,battery,and misc. other things and Iv'e got a great dailey driver. Then I stopped at a house with a Fiero sitting out front for a while and picked it up for $175<BR>and got a package deal for two of them for $425. Well,thats my story about three Fieros.<BR>Oh yeah, I drove the package deals home.I just can't decide what to do with them.I'm thinking about buying 15 more and starting a roadcourse series at Indianapolis Raceway Park. Oh, what to do.||||reg||
